# Open Findings Template

Track unresolved diagnostic findings. Reviewer/critic agents diagnose only; a human decides which findings are accepted before the writer revises.

| ID | Source | Location | Finding | Severity | Human decision | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `F-001` | `<AGENT_OR_REVIEWER>` | `<SECTION_FILE:LINE>` | `<FINDING>` | critical/major/minor | accept/reject/modify/pending | open/closed |

## Rules

- Do not feed unapproved findings to the writer.
- Merge duplicates before asking for author decisions.
- Close findings only after a targeted revision and validation check.
